~ hint_start
Player: (Where... where am I?)
Player: (Is this a hospital?)
Player: (I should probably talk to that Nurse.)
=> END

~ hint_use_memory_box
Player: (The Nurse told me to 'use' the MemoryBox™.)
Player: (It must be that weird, hourglass-like device in this room.)
=> END

~ hint_ask_sergey
Player: (This machine requires a TechPass™. Wonder where I can find one around here...)
=> END

~ hint_need_distraction
Player: (The Old Man is a nuisance. I need to find a way to shut him up.)
=> END

~ hint_clog_toilet_main
=> hint_need_distraction

~ hint_clog_toilet_bathroom
=> hint_need_distraction

~ hint_toilet_clogged
=> hint_need_distraction

~ hint_aida_gone
=> hint_need_distraction

~ hint_use_zanopram
=> hint_need_distraction

~ hint_wrong_drugs
Player: (I've given the other drugs to him, but they haven't put him to sleep yet.)
Player: (I should put him to sleep with Zzzanopram.)
Player: (Soon as I'm done playing with him. Hehe.)
=> END

~ hint_return_to_sergey
Player: (The Old Man's asleep.)
Player: (Time to return to Sergey.)
=> END

~ hint_has_techpass
Player: (I have the TechPass™.)
Player: (All I need to do now is use it on that weird machine.)
=> END

# --- Out of Order / Speedrun Variants ---
# If the player does things before getting the objective, their
# overarching goal is still just to figure out the Memory Box / TechPass.

~ hint_toilet_clogged_no_context
=> hint_ask_sergey

~ hint_aida_gone_no_context
=> hint_ask_sergey

~ hint_use_zanopram_no_context
=> hint_ask_sergey

~ hint_wrong_drugs_no_context
=> hint_ask_sergey
